        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Da̱p Yecu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 2:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛn ni̱ni tɔ̱tɔ̱ cu ruac wä raar kä Thii-thɛr Ɔ-gäth-täth, i̱ ba ciööt nath diaal gɔ̱r wi̱i̱ muɔ̱ɔ̱n kɛɛliw. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.2.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.2.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 2:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ɛ jɛn jio̱l gɔ̱rä ciöötni, mëë Ku-ri-niäth a rueec kä Thi-ri-ya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.2.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.2.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 2:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu nɛy diaal wä dho̱rikiɛn, kɛ ɣöö ba ciöötkiɛn wä gɔ̱r. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.2.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.2.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 2:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Jo-thɛp jiɛɛn kä Na-dha-rɛth, ro̱o̱l Gɛ̈-lɛ-li. Cuɛ wä rɛy ciëŋ Dee-bid mi cɔal i̱ Beth-lɛ-ɣɛm mi te kä Ju-dia, kɛ ɣöö ɛ raan thuɔk duëël Dee-bid. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.2.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.2.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 2:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cuɛ wä kɛ ɣöö ba ciötdɛ wä gɔ̱r kɛɛl kɛnɛ Mɛri, mi cɛ la̱r kuën, kä ruetdɛ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.2.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.2.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 2:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mëë tekɛ ɛn wi̱ni, cu gua̱a̱th dapädɛ cop. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.2.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.2.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 2:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cuɛ dap kɛ kɛ̱̈ɛ̱̈dɛ mi dho̱o̱l. Kä cuɛ jɛ kuäth kɛ bi̱i̱ gatdä mi pay dap, kä cuɛ jɛ tɔa̱a̱c rɛy diëny mi jek ɣɔ̱k wal thi̱n, kɛ ɣöö thilɛ kɛ gua̱a̱th mi ca jek dueel ja̱a̱li.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.2.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.2.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yiëën deet kɛnɛ ja̱a̱k",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 2:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.2.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.2.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 2:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rɛy rööl ɛmɔ tëëkɛ tha̱a̱ŋ yiëën deet ti yiënkɛ detkiɛn rɛy dɔaar kɛ wäär. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.2.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.2.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 2:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu jääk Kua̱r ni Kuɔth jɔɔc nhiamdiɛn, kä cu buay Kua̱r ni Kuoth kɛ mɛr, kä cukɛ dual ɛlɔ̱ŋ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.2.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.2.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 2:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä duundɛ ɣöö cu jääk nhial kɛ jiök i̱, “/Cuarɛ dual. Kä nɛ̈nɛ jɛ, ɣän nöŋä ni yɛ thuk ti gɔw ti la nyin tɛthkä lɔaac kɛ kui̱ nɛɛni diaal. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.2.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.2.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 2:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛ ɣöö ɛn walɛ rɛy ciëŋ Dee-bid ca yɛ da̱p Kään in la Mɛ-thia, Kuäär ni Kuoth. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.2.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.2.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 2:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä bi mɛmɛ nyuuth kä yɛ. Bia gat jek ca kuäth kɛ bi̱i̱ gatdä mi pay dap, kä ca jɛ tɔa̱a̱c rɛy diëny mi jek ɣɔ̱k wal thi̱n.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.2.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.2.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 2:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä ni ɛn guäth ɛmɔ cu buɔ̱n ji̱ nhial mi di̱i̱t kɛ pärikä kɛ jääk nhial kɛɛl, liakɛ Kuoth wäkɛ i̱,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.2.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.2.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 2:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.2.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.2.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 2:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mëë ci ja̱a̱k nhial jiɛɛn kä kɛ, lockɛ nhial, cu yiëën deet ruac kärɔ̱ i̱, “Kuanɛ wä ɛn täämɛ kä Beth-lɛ-ɣɛm, banɛ min ci tuɔɔk wä nɛn, min ci Kuäär ni Kuoth ɛ la̱r kɔn ɛ.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.2.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.2.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 2:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cukɛ wä kɛ pɛ̈th, kä cukɛ Mɛri kɛnɛ Jo-thɛp jek, kä te gat tɔ̱ɔ̱cä rɛy diëny mi jek ɣɔ̱k wal thi̱n. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.2.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.2.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 2:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mëë cikɛ jɛ nɛn, cukɛ ruac ëë ca la̱rkɛ kɛ kui̱ gatdä nɔmɔ la̱t naath. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.2.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.2.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 2:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu nɛy diaal tëë ca jɛ liŋ ga̱a̱c kɛ tin ca la̱tkɛ ɛ yiëën deet. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.2.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.2.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 2:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Mɛri rieet ti̱ti̱ diaal käp, kä cuɛ kɛ la̱th lɔɔcdɛ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.2.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.2.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 2:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu yiëën deet loc jɔk puanykɛ Kuoth, kä liakɛ jɛ kɛ kui̱ ŋɔaani diaal tëë ci kɛn kɛ liŋ kä ca nɛn, ce̱tkɛ min ca la̱r kɛ.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.2.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.2.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ca̱k cio̱tdä Yecu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 2:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.2.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.2.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 2:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mëë ci ni̱n da̱ŋ bädäk thuuk, cua gua̱a̱th cuelä gatdä. Kä cua ciötdɛ cɔl i̱ Yecu. Ɛ jɛn ciöt ëë ca ka̱m jɛ ɛ jääk nhial ni mëë /ka̱n jɛ ni ruet ɛ man.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.2.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.2.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Naŋ Yecu luaak Kuɔth",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 2:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.2.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.2.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 2:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä mëë ci gua̱a̱th leyädiɛn cop ce̱tnikɛ ciaŋ ŋuɔ̱tni Muthɛ. Cukɛ gat naŋ kä Jɛ-ru-tha-lɛm, naŋkɛ jɛ nhiam Kua̱r ni Kuoth. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.2.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.2.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 2:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "(Kä ce̱tkɛ mi ca gɔ̱r rɛy ŋuɔ̱tni Kua̱r ni Kuɔth i̱",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.2.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.2.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2:23",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Ɣöth 13:2.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", “Key diaal ti tut bakɛ lëy Kuäär ni Kuoth ala ti lɛ̈y lɛ̈ɛ̈y”). ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.2.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.2.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 2:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cukɛ muc thöp kuäär ni Kuoth ce̱tkɛ min ca lar rɛy ŋuɔ̱tni Kua̱r ni Kuoth i̱",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.2.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.2.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2:24",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Liib 12:8.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", “Thöpɛ guɔ̱kni da̱ŋ rɛw kiɛ dɛy kunööri rɛw.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.2.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.2.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 2:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.2.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.2.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 2:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Täämɛ, tëëkɛ wut kɛl kä Jɛ-ru-tha-lɛm mi cɔal ciötdɛ i̱ Cim-on. Ɛ wut mi gua̱n cuŋni mi ŋääth Kuoth, kä liipɛ ni ka̱n ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl. Kä te Yiëë in Gɔaa in Rɛl Rɔ kɛ jɛ kɛɛl. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.2.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.2.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 2:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä ca nyuɔ̱th jɛ ɛ Yiëë in Gɔaa in Rɛl Rɔ, ɛn ɣöö /cɛ bi li̱w mi /kenɛ Kuäär ni Kuoth ni Mɛ-thia nɛn. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.2.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.2.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 2:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cu Yiëë Kuɔth Thi-mɛ-ɔn naŋ luaak Kuɔth. Mëë ci diëëth gat ni Yecu nööŋ rɛy luaak Kuɔth, kɛ ɣöö ba jɛ ben lät kä ŋɔaani ce̱tkɛ ciaŋ ŋuɔ̱tni, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.2.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.2.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 2:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "cu Thi-mɛ-ɔn gat käp kɛ tetkɛ, kä cuɛ Kuoth liak, wëë i̱,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.2.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.2.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 2:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.2.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.2.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 2:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu gua̱n kɛnɛ man ga̱a̱c kɛ tëë ca lat kɛ kui̱dɛ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.2.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.2.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 2:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Cim-on kɛ poth, kä cuɛ man gatdä ni Mɛri jiök i̱, “Ca gat ɛmɛ di̱eth, kɛ ɣöö bɛ nɛy ti ŋuan däk kä bɛ nɛy ti ŋuan kän kä ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl, kä bɛ la nyuuth mi bi nɛy ti ŋuan ɛ lo̱k. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.2.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.2.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 2:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛ ɣöö bi ca̱r lo̱cni nɛɛni ti ŋuan jɔɔc, kä bi jiath lɔaac lɔcdu rɛt ce̱tnikɛ thɛp.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.2.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.2.35"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 2:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.2.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.2.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 2:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Täämɛ tëëkɛ ciek mi gök mi cɔal i̱ Anna, mi la nya Pan-wel thok duëël Ɛ̈-cɛr. Kä jɛn cɛ dɔŋ ɛlɔ̱ŋ. Kä ca jɛ kɔŋ kuɛn ala ciek kɛ run da̱ŋ bärɔw. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.2.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.2.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 2:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cuɛ a ciek jɔkä kɛ run ti jiɛn da̱ŋ bädäk wi̱cdɛ ŋuan. /Kenɛ lɛ wä raar luaak Kuɔth, kä duundɛ ɣöö palɛ ni Kuoth kä thɛɛk mi̱th, kä palɛ kɛ wäär kɛnɛ cäŋ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.2.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.2.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 2:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cuɛ ben ɛn guäth ɛmɔ pa̱ny, cuɛ Kuoth la̱r tɛth lɔaac, kä cuɛ ruac kɛ kui̱ gatdä lätdɛ jɛ nɛy diaal tëë liɛpkɛ Kuoth kɛ ɣöö bɛ Jɛ-ru-tha-lɛm kän.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.2.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.2.38"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Loc Yecu kä Na-dha-rɛth",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 2:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.2.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.2.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 2:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mëë cikɛ ti diaal thuk kɛ lätni ce̱tkɛ ŋuɔ̱t Kua̱r ni Kuoth, cukɛ loc kä Gɛ̈-lɛ-li dhɔriɛn kä Na-dha-rɛth. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.2.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.2.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 2:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cu gat piith, kä cuɛ buɔ̱m, cuɛ thia̱a̱ŋ kɛ pɛl, kä te puɔ̱th Kuɔth kɛ jɛ.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.2.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.2.40"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Wä Yecu luaak Kuɔth",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 2:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.2.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.2.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 2:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "La diëëthkɛ a wä kä Jɛ-ru-tha-lɛm runi diaal kɛ ti̱em Ca̱ŋ Bälä. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.2.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.2.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 2:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä mëë ci runkɛ a wäl wi̱cdɛ rɛw, cukɛ wä kä Jɛ-ru-tha-lɛm ce̱tkɛ min la wäkɛ ti̱mä ni wen. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.2.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.2.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 2:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mëë ci pek ni̱ni ti̱mä thuuk cukɛ loc jɔk, kä cu dho̱o̱l ni Yecu duɔth kä Jɛ-ru-tha-lɛm, kä duundɛ ɣöö kui̱c diëëthkɛ jɛ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.2.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.2.43"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 2:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä ɛ kɛn i̱ dɔ̱ŋ tëë kɛɛl kɛ ja̱a̱l tin kɔ̱kiɛn, cukɛ wä kɛ ja̱l ca̱ŋ kɛl. Kä cukɛ jɛ tok kɛ mi görkɛ jɛ rɛy watnikiɛn kɛnɛ mäthnikiɛn. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.2.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.2.44"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 2:45"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä mëë /ken kɛn ɛ jek, cukɛ loc Jɛ-ru-tha-lɛm, cukɛ jɛ wä go̱r. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.2.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.2.45"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "46",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 2:46"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "46",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛ kɔr ni̱ni da̱ŋ diɔ̱k cukɛ jɛ jek rɛy luaak Kuɔth, tëë nyuurä rɛy ŋi̱eecni liŋɛ ruacdiɛn, kä thiecɛ kɛ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.2.46",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.2.46"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "47",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 2:47"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "47",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cu nɛy diaal tëë liɛŋkɛ ruacdɛ ga̱a̱c kɛ ŋäcdɛ kɛ ŋɔaani kɛnɛ luɔcdɛ kɛ kɛ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.2.47",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.2.47"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "48",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 2:48"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "48",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mëë ci diëëthkɛ jɛ nɛn, cukɛ ga̱a̱c ɛlɔ̱ŋ. Kä cu man ɛ jiök i̱, “Gatdä, ɛŋu ci kɔ ciɛŋ inɛ mɔ? Guic ɛ, ɣän kɔnɛ guur cakɔ ji̱ go̱r kɛ diɛɛr lɔaac mi di̱i̱t.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.2.48",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.2.48"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "49",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 2:49"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "49",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cuɛ kɛ jiök i̱, “Kä ɛŋu go̱o̱r yɛn ɣä mɔ? /Ka̱nɛ jɛ ŋa̱c ɛn ɣöö bi ɣän dhil tey rɛy luaak Gua̱a̱r?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.2.49",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.2.49"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "50",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 2:50"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "50",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä duundɛ ɣöö /ken ruacdɛ cop lɔɔcdiɛn. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.2.50",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.2.50"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "51",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 2:51"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "51",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cuɛ loc kä Na-dha-rɛth kɛ kɛ kɛɛl, kä cuɛ kɛ luɔ̱th. Kä cu man ŋɔak diaal ti̱ti̱ käp kɛ lɔcdɛ.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.2.51",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.2.51"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
