              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cu Yecu piith kɛ pɛl, kɛn pi̱eth pua̱ny, kä cu tɛ̈th lɔaac Kuɔth kɛnɛ naath kɛ jɛ rɔ rep.",
          "type": "text",
